|   |
|   +-- DKB (Container Currency: EUR)
|   |   +-- Institution Summary
|   |   +-- Girokonto
|   |   +-- Tagesgeld
|   |   +-- Depot
|   |
|   +-- Broker X (Container Currency: USD)
|   |   +-- Institution Summary
|   |   +-- USD/EUR/CHF Cash Accounts
|   |   +-- Depot
|   |
